    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Fantasy World - You are a male protagonist living in a fantasy world, and the town you live in is often invaded by monsters or other countries and lacks resources. Therefore, there are many female protagonists who need your help, and of course they will pay you. . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has five weapons to choose from, swords, guns, axes, throwing knives, and bows. Each weapon has a unique attack mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each heroine needs different resources. Players need to go to different places to collect different resources to help each heroine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced resources need to be upgraded to designated places before they can be entered (for example, level 1 mines need to be upgraded to level 1 before they can be entered)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently ten heroines, and each heroine also has three tasks for the player. After completing the task, the heroine will give gifts to the player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- When using a gift, press the AD key, the left and right keys or the left and right mouse keys to switch to the next or previous page, and scroll the mouse to zoom in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten girls are waiting for your help~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402560/extras/4782853e6cfadcb2f843108f88a678dc.avif?t=1739466008\" data-has-big width=800 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Image size is 1216x832 px</p>",
